7. The recipient handling branch (if (rebasingStateTo.isRebasing == 1)) treats the self-transfer as a real incoming transfer.
8. `toBalanceAfter` becomes `rawToBalanceAfter + x`.
9. `mintAmount` becomes `x`.
10. The contract mints `x` tokens to the attacker and decreases unminted rebase rewards by `x`.
11. The attacker’s balance increases by `x` without receiving tokens from another account.
12. The attacker repeats the process to drain available materialized rebase rewards.

