Finalize FeeSplitter accounting before any untrusted fee-recipient callback. In particular, update the trader’s fee offset immediately at the start of `_transferFees`, after Curves balance/supply changes but before the ETH transfers to the first destination (protocol/seller), the `curvesTokenSubject` (subject fee), or the referral destination (if defined) can execute recipient code.

Preferably, also deposit holder fees before untrusted fee-recipient payouts so that all holder-fee accounting is complete before callbacks.

